OL,3,GNEWSABrit winners Jungle first to
OL,4,Aheadline Latitude 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrit Award winning soul band Jungle are
OL,7,Fthe first to be announced as headliners
OL,8,Ffor the 2027 Latitude Festival.
OL,10,FThe festival, which is back for its
OL,11,F21st year, will take place from 22 to
OL,12,F25 July at Henham Park, near Southwold
OL,13,Fin Suffolk.
OL,15,FJungle's headline slot has been
OL,16,Fdescribed as a "full circle moment"
OL,17,Fafter the band, known for hits
OL,18,Fincluding Back on 74 and Volcano, made
OL,19,Ftheir Latitude debut in 2014.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
